e paprika, and mix everything together."}},{"text":{"es":"Agregamos la leche de coco, el champiñón laminado, el caldo, la salsa de soja, la mantequilla de cacahuete, un poco de jengibre y lima rallada, programamos el menú plancha durante 6 minutos.","en":"Add the coconut milk, the sliced mushrooms, the stock, the soy sauce, the peanut butter, a little grated ginger and lime zest, and select the \"Plancha\" menu for 6 minutes."},"timerMinutes":6},{"text":{"es":"Cuando queden 2 minutos, agregamos la pasta.","en":"When 2 minutes remain, add the noodles."},"timerMinutes":2},{"text":{"es":"Dejamos reposar unos minutos y servimos.","en":"Leave to stand for a few minutes and serve."}}]}